# MySQL — Hostinger hPanel > Databases (free, included in the plan).
# For local dev: docker compose up -d  →  mysql://propia:propia@localhost:3306/propia
DATABASE_URL=mysql://user:password@localhost:3306/propia

# Outbound messaging — OPTIONAL. Leads are stored in MySQL first and the panel
# reads them from there, so the portal works with none of these set. A webhook
# adds outbound delivery: a WhatsApp OTP at publish, and a copy of each lead
# pushed to whatever CRM you point it at (GoHighLevel, n8n, your own endpoint).
# Without it the publish wizard skips phone verification instead of issuing a
# code nobody can receive.
#
# The same endpoint also receives operator alerts — {"event":"operator_alert"}
# with kind "new_lead" or "review_submitted" — so a flow can forward "go look"
# to WhatsApp while routing {"event":"lead"} into the CRM. With no webhook set
# there is no alert: /admin badges the review queue and the last 24 h of leads,
# which needs no configuration at all.
LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=
# Historical alias for LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL; either name works.
GHL_WEBHOOK_URL=
GHL_API_KEY=

# Cloudflare R2 — listing photos. Free tier: 10 GB, zero egress.
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=propia-images
# Public delivery URL for the bucket. Use the bucket's own public URL
# (https://pub-<hash>.r2.dev) or a custom domain YOU HAVE MAPPED in
# Cloudflare. Do NOT point this at a domain that isn't set up —
# img.propia.com.py was the old placeholder and propia.com.py is not owned,
# so leaving it would 404 every photo the day R2 goes live (audit F64).
# Leave empty until the bucket exists: empty = stored keys pass through
# unchanged, which keeps imported remote-URL photos working.
R2_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=

# Portal contact identity (src/config/contact.ts) — footer, /contacto,
# privacy policy and Organization JSON-LD all read these. Both are OPTIONAL
# and have no fallback: leave them empty and the site shows no address and no
# WhatsApp CTA, routing everyone to the on-site lead form instead. Fill them
# in only with a mailbox/number that is actually monitored (audit F10).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ means Next inlines them at BUILD time — a rebuild is required
# after changing either, not just a restart.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_WHATSAPP=

# Claude API — barrio guides + EN translations (batch jobs, NEVER the request
# path). `npm run cron:translate` fills listings.title_en/description_en for
# the English door; with no key it refuses to run rather than writing anything,
# and the site is unaffected — publishing never calls the API, so it cannot be
# blocked by one being down (src/lib/translate.ts explains why there is no
# publish-time hook).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: the model cron:translate uses. Defaults to claude-opus-5.
ANTHROPIC_TRANSLATION_MODEL=

# Canonical host (listing detail pages are canonical here only).
# INTERIM: realestateinparaguay.com is the only production domain the founder
# owns today. Do NOT set this to propia.com.py — that domain is not owned and
# doing so resurrects broken canonicals sitewide (see src/config/verticals.ts).
NEXT_PUBLIC_CANONICAL_HOST=realestateinparaguay.com
